own paintings now hang framed in the pyramid gallery rooms (new or reset worlds)','Dance music: no more loud noise at the end - the song loops cleanly','The dancers keep dancing while you stay near - walk away or press LT to stop']},\n{v:'v1.0.82', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['Fix: the UFO comes back at night - until you finish the encounter it now arrives early in your first night, anywhere, not only in the desert']},\n{v:'v1.0.81', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['Dance music is now loud and clear - normalised and played on the music volume, with a much gentler distance fade','New calmer desert and temple music: Desert theme by yd (CC0)']},\n{v:'v1.0.80', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['New: the Egyptian dance has new music - a track by Frankie Maxwell, looping for the whole dance. Your own Custom dance music in Settings still takes over if you pick one']},\n{v:'v1.0.79', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['Fix: in the desert the main background music now crossfades out as the desert temple tune comes in, and back again when you leave, so only one plays at a time']},\n{v:'v1.0.78', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['New: new original desert dance music for the Egyptian dance - flute, oud and hand drums at the same tempo as the moves','New: a new original Egyptian temple tune plays in the desert and round the pyramid','New: Settings then Audio then Custom dance music - choose your own music file for the dance. It is kept only on this device and never uploaded. Use built-in switches back','Egyptians: dance moves redone to match the video, and the terrain music now fades out for the whole dance while the dance music plays from the group']},\n{v:'v1.0.77', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['Egyptians: dance moves redone to match the video - clasp, arm bars, L-shapes, the diamond, hands on head, eye circles, the flute, face covers, open hands, paws and the double point','Fix: during the dance the terrain and desert music now fade out for the whole dance and come back after, and the dance music really plays in 3D from the group (it was silent before)','New: ready for your own music - put your dance track in as assets/music/dance_custom.mp3 and your Egyptian temple track as assets/music/temple_custom.mp3 and they play instead of the built-in tunes']},\n{v:'v1.0.76', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['New: a Patch notes button on the main menu right under Play and Settings - controller friendly too','New: water really flows now - moving ripples that follow the river, foam on the crests and sky reflections (three.js water normals, MIT)','New: lava flows too - a glowing crust that slowly creeps along and pulses with heat (ambientCG Lava004, CC0)','New: a Bag of Everything in your inventory - hold it and use it to open a bag with one stack of every item and block in the game. Given once per world, take what you like and put things back']},\n{v:'v1.0.75', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['Fix: Reset world now hides behind the Glencraft loading screen - you see the glowing logo and Resetting world while the new glen is made, never a frozen game or the old land, and it lifts once the new world is ready and drawn']},\n{v:'v1.0.74', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['Fix: Reset world keeps everything you carry - inventory, armour and XP come with you to the new world. The starter kit only goes to brand-new worlds','New: the alien encounter is less than half as long (about 95 seconds) and every line is spoken only once','New: the alien now waits inside the crashed saucer until you walk within about 4 blocks of it','New: the vision clips play full screen and fully opaque, with three more public-domain NASA clips - an aurora from the ISS, a solar flare and a volcano erupting from orbit','Fix: the drawn bomb picture is gone from the visions','New: the chrome YEAR 24000 is back - every block, the pyramid, sand, statues and trees turn mirror chrome with a neon grid floor, a purple sky and saucers, built behind the last clip so it starts smoothly, and everything is restored after','Mobs: no mobs spawn and all mobs pause during the YEAR 24000 vision, then carry on as normal','New: the saucer crash crater fills with a flat, glowing pool of Element 115','Fix: the TV meteor warning now stays on screen for about 10 seconds','Egyptians: the Egyptians outside the pyramid stay together in one village group and never vanish when you walk away','Fix: the alien painting now hangs inside the chest room down the pyramid staircase, and only after the encounter','Fix: the old grass block is gone from the loading screen']},\n{v:'v1.0.73', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['Fix: LT on an Egyptian works again on controller and touch - it picks the nearest Egyptian within about 4 blocks in front of you, so you no longer need perfect aim','New: the LT dance chain is back in full - the Egyptians group up in rows, then dance the keyframed routine in sync with the music','New: YEAR 24000 turns every block mirror silver again on top of the original vision, and everything goes back to normal after','New: the meteor is back - after the encounter the TV says brace for impact, the alien voice repeats it with a deep roar and the meteor starts as a far speck and grows as it comes in','Mobs: the Timmer Tiki stays switched off','Fix: patch notes for v1.0.66 to v1.0.73 are all listed in Pause then Info then Patch notes']},\n{v:'v1.0.72', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['Fix: the alien encounter is back to the original version - the earlier voice, the earlier cool hallucinations and the original YEAR 24000, smooth with no lag','Story: the alien speaks for itself in first person - its own warnings about watching your skies, your weapons and what fell from the sky','Mobs: the Timmer Tiki that kept knocking is switched off - it no longer spawns or makes sounds and any already in your world are removed']},\n{v:'v1.0.71', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['Fix: the alien encounter, the YEAR 24000 vision and the meteor are back to the smooth v1.0.67 versions (no more lag), keeping only the safety timer so you can never stay frozen','Story: the alien now speaks for itself - its own warnings about watching your skies, your weapons and what fell, in the ethereal voice, with no names or captions','Fix: Reset world deletes the old save first, never shows a could not save error and builds the new map nearest first a few chunks at a time','Fix: Reset world is a full new world - new seed and fresh mobs, story, inventory, XP and position (settings are kept)','New: the big saucer only appears at night and flies off at dawn - a crashed wreck stays','Fix: the spinning grass block on the loading screen is no longer black','New: new and reset worlds start with a map, a diamond axe and an unlimited XP splash potion - throw it as often as you like for a shower of XP orbs','Fix: LT on an Egyptian only starts or stops the dance - it never places a block or uses your item','New: a glowing controller and Bluetooth badge in the bottom right of the main menu - it lights up when a controller is connected','Egyptians: the dance gathers everyone into neat rows first, then they all start in sync']},\n{v:'v1.0.70', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['New: when you press LT on an Egyptian the nearby Egyptians first walk over and group up in neat rows facing you, stepping around blocks','New: once everyone is in place (or after about 6 seconds) they all start the dance on the same beat in perfect sync and the music starts with them','Fix: when the dance ends the Egyptians walk back to their stones, prayers, fields and drums']},\n{v:'v1.0.69', d:'2026-11-01', notes:['New: animal sounds are true 3D - every sheep, pig, duck and haggis call comes from where the animal stands, pans left and right as you turn and fades out by about 24 blocks','Fix: animal voices no longer pile up - one call per animal at a time and only a few at once','Mobs: pigs are a proper animated pig again (walk, idle, eat and run) wearing the real pig photo - the face and snout on the head and the pink wrinkled skin on the body','Mobs: pig hitbox, behaviour and mud rolling are unchanged','Audio: animal sounds are much quieter and the harsh sheep yell is gone - only gentle bleats','New: sound occlusion - sounds behind walls or heard from indoors are muffled and quieter','Fix: the alien abduction no longer freezes - the dialogue and music are back, the alien voice is ethereal with echo, chorus and airy reverb','Visual: YEAR 24000 vision is cleaner - no daylight sky, clouds or speech bubble showing through and the giant robots stand farther away','New: the meteor appears the moment the alien says brace for impact - a small far speck that grows as it comes in with a building roar into the impact','New: original Egyptian desert soundtrack crossfades in when you walk onto the sand and fades back out when you leave, UFO music takes over when it arrives','Fix: the alien painting only appears after the alien encounter and hangs flat on the hall wall','New: many more Egyptians around the pyramid - carrying stones, kneeling in prayer, farming with hoes and playing drums','New: aim at an Egyptian and press LT to start a synced meditation dance - every Egyptian nearby dances the same routine to an original 97 BPM arabesque track heard from the dancers, press LT again or walk away to stop']},\n",1)
